    "turn_text": "Snapshots, brought to you by We the People. I'm Sean Duffy. I'm from Wisconsin's 7th congressional district, which is central, northern and western Wisconsin. I grew up my whole life in the small town with five brothers, five sisters, for a total of 11 Duffy kids. And grew up doing lumberjack sports. I felt like I had an idyllic upbringing in northern Wisconsin. I was out doing a competition, a lumberjack competition, out in California, in Fresno, of all places. And as I was there, there was no technology back then, so I had one of these old cameras that I would turn on and off, and I said...",
